action "Audit AUR packages"
exec  pacman -Qqm --color never
log   audit AUDIT: AUR audit: 2 checked, 1 flagged
snap  foo-git="" yay-bin="jguer"
audit 2 foreign package(s) checked against the AUR
audit
audit ✖ 0 look closely  ⚠ 1 glance  ✔ 1 clean
audit
audit ⚠ foo-git  orphaned · 0 votes
audit
audit First audit: maintainers saved as the baseline. Adoptions and maintainer changes are flagged from the next audit on.
audit Recent = pushed within 72h, the same window as an AUR cooldown hook.
end   outcome=report errs=0 skipped=0
